{"text":{"en":{"KSNA | [회사명] 베어링":"KSNA | [Company Name] Bearing","<img src=\"assets/ksna_diagram.png\" alt=\"KSNA 도면\" style=\"height: 240px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain;\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ 단면도 — 셋트스크류 + 핀 고정, 플랜지 일체형 · 정면도<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d=나사 안지름 · B=너트 폭 · d2=바깥지름</span></p>":"<img src=\"assets/ksna_diagram.png\" alt=\"KSNA Drawing\" style=\"height: 240px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain;\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ Cross-section — Set screw + pin fixing, integrated flange type · Front view<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d=Thread bore diameter · B=Nut width · d2=Outer diameter</span></p>"},"ja":{"KSNA | [회사명] 베어링":"KSNA | [会社名]ベアリング","<img src=\"assets/ksna_diagram.png\" alt=\"KSNA 도면\" style=\"height: 240px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain;\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ 단면도 — 셋트스크류 + 핀 고정, 플랜지 일체형 · 정면도<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d=나사 안지름 · B=너트 폭 · d2=바깥지름</span></p>":"<img src=\"assets/ksna_diagram.png\" alt=\"KSNA 図面\" style=\"height: 240px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain;\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ 断面図 — 止めねじ+ピン固定、フランジ一体型・正面図<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d=ねじ内径・B=ナット幅・d2=外径</span></p>"},"zh":{"KSNA | [회사명] 베어링":"KSNA | [公司名]轴承","<img src=\"assets/ksna_diagram.png\" alt=\"KSNA 도면\" style=\"height: 240px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain;\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ 단면도 — 셋트스크류 + 핀 고정, 플랜지 일체형 · 정면도<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d=나사 안지름 · B=너트 폭 · d2=바깥지름</span></p>":"<img src=\"assets/ksna_diagram.png\" alt=\"KSNA 图纸\" style=\"height: 240px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain;\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ 剖面图 — 定位螺钉+销钉固定,法兰一体型・正视图<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d=螺纹内径・B=螺母宽度・d2=外径</span></p>"}},"attrs":{"en":{"KSNA 도면":"KSNA Drawing"},"ja":{"KSNA 도면":"KSNA 図面"},"zh":{"KSNA 도면":"KSNA 图纸"}}}